---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="About · Starrylume"
    description="About Starrylume and Starrymist."
>
    <main class="about-page">
        <header class="about-header">
            <h1>About</h1>
            <p>A little about me and this place.</p>
        </header>

        <div class="about-content">
            <p>
                Hi, I'm Starrylume, an undergraduate student. 
            </p>

            <p>
                Driven by curiosity, I'm often interested in things I haven't encountered before. So I studied pharmaceutical engineering in my first year. Then I switched my major to biology in my second year while also minoring in physics. At the end of my second year, I started studying about computer science and became interested in computer graphics. What really appeals to me is using computation to solve problems in physics, chemistry, and biology. As a gamer, I'm also fascinated by creating virtual worlds. These two directions may look quite different, but they feel closely related to me.
            </p>

            <p>
                Currently, I'm studying inorganic chemistry and physical chemistry for an upcoming exam. At the same time, I continue studying data structures and algorithms through the publicly available materials for UIUC CS 225.
            </p>

            <p>
                I created this blog to keep and share what I learn, what I experience, and what I think about. The topic may change over time, just as my interest do.
            </p>

            <p>
                You can find a more concise overview of my projects and current interests at <a href="starrymist.me">starrymist.me</a> <span></span>
            </p>
            <p>I am also on 
                <a
                    href="https://github.com/starrylume"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noreferrer"
                >
                    GitHub
                </a>
                ,<span></span> or you can reach me at <span></span>
                <a href="mailto:contact@starrymist.me">
                    contact@starrymist.me
                </a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>

<style>
    .about-page {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        max-width: 760px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: var(--space-3xl) var(--space-xl);
    }

    .about-header {
        margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
    }

    .about-header h1 {
        margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm);
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    .about-header p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .about-content {
        color: var(--text);
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .about-content p {
        margin: 1.25rem 0;
    }

    .about-content a {
        color: var(--firefly);
        text-underline-offset: 0.25rem;
    }

    .about-content a:hover {
        color: var(--text);
        opacity: 1;
    }
</style>
